A daylight reading room: warm paper light, ink-brown text and a muted terracotta accent, with a serif clock as the one focal point. Colours and type only — the layout, search bar and websites keep the shape they already have.

```json
{
  "kind": "mnt.theme-pack",
  "packVersion": 2,
  "cssApiVersion": 1,
  "meta": {
    "name": "Daylight Paper",
    "description": "Warm paper background with ink-brown serif type and a soft terracotta accent, tuned for daytime reading.",
    "notes": "A soft paper-textured or plain warm off-white wallpaper suits it; no image is required."
  },
  "theme": {
    "mode": "light",
    "colorLight": {
      "bg": "#f4ecdd",
      "surface": "#fbf6ec",
      "text": "#33291f",
      "accent": "#9c5531"
    },
    "font": {
      "display": "cormorant",
      "ui": "system"
    },
    "radius": 8,
    "shadow": 16,
    "glass": 0,
    "density": "comfortable",
    "scale": 1,
    "iconShape": "circle",
    "iconSize": 68
  },
  "background": {
    "type": "color",
    "color": "#f4ecdd",
    "dim": 0
  },
  "css": ".mnt-clock {\n  letter-spacing: -0.02em;\n  font-weight: 600;\n}\n.mnt-date {\n  color: var(--mnt-text-muted);\n}\n.mnt-search {\n  box-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(51, 41, 31, 0.06);\n  transition: border-color var(--mnt-dur-base) var(--mnt-ease), box-shadow var(--mnt-dur-base) var(--mnt-ease);\n}\n.mnt-search:focus-within {\n  border-color: var(--mnt-accent);\n  box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(51, 41, 31, 0.1);\n}\n.mnt-link-icon {\n  transition: transform var(--mnt-dur-fast) var(--mnt-ease);\n}\n.mnt-link:hover .mnt-link-name {\n  color: var(--mnt-accent);\n}"
}
```

```json
{
  "kind": "mnt.theme-pack",
  "packVersion": 2,
  "cssApiVersion": 1,
  "meta": {
    "name": "Night Slate",
    "description": "Deep slate-blue surfaces with a soft amber accent, muted glow and gentle shapes to keep late-night browsing easy on the eyes.",
    "notes": "A plain dark wallpaper or a very dim, soft-focus night photo works best; keep it low-contrast so the amber accent stays the only bright point."
  },
  "theme": {
    "mode": "dark",
    "color": {
      "bg": "#232b38",
      "surface": "#2b3441",
      "text": "#e4e0d8",
      "accent": "#e0a866"
    },
    "font": {
      "display": "system",
      "ui": "system"
    },
    "radius": 16,
    "shadow": 22,
    "glass": 20,
    "density": "comfortable",
    "iconShape": "circle",
    "iconSize": 72
  },
  "background": {
    "type": "theme",
    "dim": 20
  },
  "css": ".mnt-clock {
  letter-spacing: -0.015em;
  color: var(--mnt-text);
  text-shadow: 0 0 24px rgba(224, 168, 102, 0.16);
}
.mnt-date {
  color: var(--mnt-text-muted);
}
.mnt-search {
  border-color: var(--mnt-border);
  background: var(--mnt-surface);
  transition: border-color var(--mnt-dur-base) var(--mnt-ease), box-shadow var(--mnt-dur-base) var(--mnt-ease);
}
.mnt-search:focus-within {
  border-color: var(--mnt-accent);
  box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(224, 168, 102, 0.14);
}
.mnt-link-icon {
  box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px var(--mnt-border);
  transition: box-shadow var(--mnt-dur-base) var(--mnt-ease), transform var(--mnt-dur-fast) var(--mnt-ease);
}
.mnt-link:hover .mnt-link-icon {
  box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px var(--mnt-accent), 0 0 18px rgba(224, 168, 102, 0.18);
}
.mnt-link-name {
  color: var(--mnt-text-muted);
  transition: color var(--mnt-dur-fast) var(--mnt-ease);
}
.mnt-link:hover .mnt-link-name {
  color: var(--mnt-text);
}
.mnt-group-title {
  color: var(--mnt-text-faint);
}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) {
  .mnt-link:hover .mnt-link-icon {
    transform: translateY(-1px);
  }
}"
}
```

A late-night palette: cool slate blue replaces the current teal-leaning background so the screen stays low-glare, while a soft amber accent provides the only warm, bright point. The clock gets a faint amber halo as the focal point, the search bar warms on focus, and website tiles stay quiet until hovered.

A soft matcha light theme: cream-to-sage gradient backdrop, rounded icons, and gentle shadows. Only colours, shape and light mode are touched — your layout and widgets stay exactly as they are.

