The palette leans on warm sand (`#f2e3d2`) with cream surfaces so the terracotta accent reads clearly without glare, and Cormorant gives the clock a soft, hand-thrown feel that fits the clay idea. Spacious density plus 88px circular icons keeps everything airy and inviting.

