The fix: `layout.areas` has three rows of a single column each (`overview`, `bookmarks`, `sidebar`), so the grid only has **one** column. The two-column `columns` array was the mismatch — it needs a single track. I've made it one `1fr` column (the `narrow` breakpoint already used one column, so it's consistent) and left everything else untouched.

