The idea: keep the cool water palette you already like, but push it lighter and airier, swap the system clock for Cormorant (gives the new-tab a distinct, quiet character), and let the search bar be the only thing that "reacts" — a tinted hairline that glows softly on focus. Websites get a small lift on hover instead of a glow so the clock stays the focal point.

