I can't include the remote font or the remote wallpaper — external `url()` references aren't allowed, and neither `@font-face` with a remote source nor a linked hero image is part of the CSS API. Here's the editorial idea carried by palette, type scale, spacing and a single quiet effect on the clock instead; a wallpaper is left for you to add in the background settings.

